aii:CommitmentBreach rdfs:subClassOf gufo:Situation .

aii:MandateAmendment rdfs:subClassOf gufo:Event .

aii:NormException rdfs:subClassOf gufo:Object .

<https://github.com/InformationServiceSystems/ai-intent/ontology#claim/claim%3Aanonymous-%3Ecentral> a gufo:ExtrinsicMode,
